WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.216
At the end of the Sui dynasty, wars raged everywhere and the people fell into suffering.

00:00:06.566 --> 00:00:10.214
People left their homes and fled in every direction to escape the wars.

00:00:10.564 --> 00:00:14.443
Forces in every region rose in arms one after another, and the land fell into contention.

00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:19.833
Army after army raised its banners, each hoping to bring peace to the land.

00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:26.783
In the year 618, the Tang dynasty was founded and a new dynasty was born.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:32.005
The news spread everywhere, and people everywhere longed for peaceful days.

00:00:32.355 --> 00:00:38.783
The Sui dynasty gradually left the stage of history, and the short-lived dynasty came to its close.

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:43.741
The old palace grew quiet, with only the afterglow of the sunset remaining.

00:00:44.091 --> 00:00:50.355
The streets and markets of Tang came alive, and the people lived and worked in peace and contentment.

00:00:50.705 --> 00:00:55.529
Shops opened their doors to customers, and children played in the streets.

00:00:55.879 --> 00:01:03.631
The eastern sun shone over the flourishing Tang dynasty, and a hopeful new era began.

